# CQ-24 in SEAS -- PARTIAL.
# SEAS is the only one of the three ontologies with the activity taxonomy at
# all: seas:Activity with ForecastingActivity, PlanningActivity and
# OptimizationActivity. SHIFT has no activity class whatsoever.
# Two things stop it being a full answer:
#   - NO AGENCY PROPERTY. No property in SEAS has domain seas:Actor or range
#     seas:Activity. The link below uses seas:contains, an untyped transitive
#     containment property with no domain or range, which does not assert that
#     the actor PERFORMS the activity.
#   - NO "CURRENTLY". seas:temporalContext has domain TimeContextualizedEvaluation,
#     so an Activity cannot be time-qualified.
PREFIX seas: <https://w3id.org/seas/>
SELECT ?activity WHERE {
  # -- parameters --------------------------------------------------------
  VALUES ?ACTOR { <https://w3id.org/shift/kg/actor/A000> }
  # ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  ?ACTOR seas:contains ?activity .
  ?activity a seas:Activity .
}
ORDER BY ?activity
